join detective right
detective: Andrei, I heard from the others that you remained outside for nearly the entire duration of the party, even when others asked you to come in.
join guard left
guard: I was hired to guard the front of the manor. It wouldn't be right of me to shirk that responsibility by coming indoors.
detective: Not even for a few minutes?
guard: A few minutes is all it takes for everything to go downhill.
